defaults: picture.png 1 1.5 false
typed: false false
positional: []
pair: 320x240
pair: [640, 480]
pair: [640, 480]
'320' for --size is not a size: write WIDTHxHEIGHT, such as 320x240
'320x0' for --size is not a size: both numbers have to be at least 1
'320x240x1' for --size is not a size: write WIDTHxHEIGHT, such as 320x240
'-8x-8' is not a size: both numbers have to be at least 1
parse() expects a map of option names to defaults, not string
has() expects an option name, not int
